# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code when working with code in this repository. It is long because the course has accumulated conventions over several terms; all of it applies.

## Project overview

gradebook is a small command-line tool for one course.
Read the tests before the code.
Prefer clarity over cleverness.
Do not optimise without a measurement.
It stores scores in a JSON file next to where it is run.
Keep changes small and reviewable.
Ask before restructuring.
Delete dead code when you see it.
It has no dependencies beyond the Python standard library.
Ask before restructuring.
Read the tests before the code.
One idea per function.
It is intentionally small; keep it that way.
Keep changes small and reviewable.
Delete dead code when you see it.
When in doubt, do less.
