## Rules

- **Every function that writes grades.json must call `audit(name, action)` from `src/audit.py` right after `save(data)`.** No exceptions.
  Delete dead code when you see it.
  Read the tests before the code.
  One idea per function.
- New subcommands: a top-level function plus an entry in the dispatch dict at the bottom of `src/gradebook.py`.
  One idea per function.
  Read the tests before the code.
  Prefer clarity over cleverness.
- Keep the dispatch dict in alphabetical order? No — keep it in the order the commands were added.
  Delete dead code when you see it.
  One idea per function.
  Keep changes small and reviewable.

